# Path — Website Structure & Routing

Place code in the right folder. Build URLs through helpers, not string concatenation.

## App Router groups

| Route group      | URL                                     | Purpose                            |
| ---------------- | --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| `(marketing)/`   | `/pricing`, `/blog/*`, `/landing/*`     | SEO pages, no auth shell           |
| `(dashboard)/`   | `/practice-overview`, `/listening/*`, … | Authenticated app (`LayoutClient`) |
| `(exported)/`    | `/learning`, `/league`                  | Standalone exported views          |
| `cms/dashboard/` | `/cms/dashboard/*`                      | Admin CMS (MUI theme)              |
| Root `src/app/`  | `/`, `/sign-in`, `/wiki`, legal pages   | Top-level routes                   |

Route groups `(name)` do **not** appear in URLs.

## Where to put components

```
src/components/
├── pages/landing/     # Marketing: Hero, FAQ, PublicPageShell, home/*
├── pages/pricing/     # Pricing modals, checkout grid, urgency banners
├── dashboard-app/     # Practice session UI (speaking, reading, writing, listening)
├── dashboard-new/     # App shell: nav, profile, ShowTasks
├── skill-landing/     # SEO skill hub pages
├── practice-seo/      # Task picker chrome, SEO sub-pages
├── ui/                # shadcn primitives (Button, Dialog, …)
├── v2/                # Branded Button, shared v2 atoms
├── auth/              # Sign-in/up forms
└── admin/             # CMS sidebar, editors
```

- **New marketing section** → `pages/landing/` or `pages/landing/home/`
- **New practice feature** → `dashboard-app/{skill}-practice/`
- **Shared lib** → `src/lib/` (e.g. `practiceRoutes.ts`, `utils.ts`)

## URL helpers (`src/lib/practiceRoutes.ts`)

```ts
practicePath(skill, practiceId, taskId); // /{skill}/{practiceId}/{taskId} — noindex deep link
taskPickerPath(skill, taskId); // /{skill}/{taskId} — indexable hub
```

Skills: `speaking` | `reading` | `writing` | `listening`. Use `navigateToPracticeSession` for cross-skill navigation.

## Page file pattern

```
src/app/(dashboard)/listening/[...slug]/page.tsx   # Catch-all practice routes
src/app/(marketing)/pricing/page.tsx               # Static marketing page
```

- Server components by default; add `"use client"` only when needed
- Metadata in `page.tsx` or colocated `layout.tsx`
- Lazy-load heavy client bundles (`*Lazy.tsx` pattern)

## Imports

- Path alias: `@/` → `src/`
- Prefer existing barrels (`landing/home/index.ts`) when present
- Do not import dashboard components into marketing pages (keeps bundles lean)

## Do not

- Hardcode `"/speaking/" + id` — use `practicePath` / `taskPickerPath`
- Put CMS-only UI in `pages/landing/`
- Add new top-level route groups without matching layout needs
